sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor PH as Policyholder
    participant API as FastAPI backend
    actor ADJ as Adjuster
    actor ADM as Admin

    Note over PH,API: Claim already analysed by the AI assistant (status: draft)

    PH->>API: POST /claims/{id}/start
    API->>API: re-verify verdict = covered and clause exists in DB
    API-->>PH: reference CLM-…, status submitted ("AI Verified")

    PH->>API: GET /adjusters?category=… then POST /bookings (slot)
    API->>API: atomic slot free → booked, claim.adjuster = adjuster
    API-->>ADJ: notification "new booking"
    API-->>PH: booking confirmed, status adjuster_booked ("Pending Adjuster")

    loop each required document
        PH->>API: POST /me/claims/{id}/documents (JPEG/PNG/PDF ≤ 5 MB)
        API-->>ADJ: notification "document uploaded"
    end

    ADJ->>API: POST …/documents/{doc}/review (verified / rejected + note)
    API-->>PH: notification "document verified / rejected"

    ADJ->>API: POST /adjuster/claims/{id}/inspection (notes)
    API-->>PH: status inspected, notification

    ADJ->>API: POST /adjuster/claims/{id}/settlement (amount)
    API->>API: check amount ≤ sum insured and no documents outstanding
    API-->>PH: status settlement_proposed ("In Review")

    ADM->>API: POST /admin/claims/{id}/decision {approve}
    API->>API: payout_due = today + 5 days
    API-->>PH: status approved, notification with payout date

    ADM->>API: POST /admin/claims/{id}/decision {pay}
    API-->>PH: status settled ("Paid Out"), notification "payout sent"

    opt Admin rejects at any open stage
        ADM->>API: decision {reject, reason}
        API-->>PH: status rejected + reason
    end
